# --- secrets / infra: never needed inside the image. Patterns without `**/` match at the context
# ROOT only (Docker rule), which is why `*.plan` alone would not have excluded the saved terraform
# plans (they embed tfstate with every secret) that the standalone trace was sweeping into /app.
infrastructure
**/*.plan
**/*.tfplan
**/*.tfstate*
**/*.tfvars
# --- tests, fixtures, scratch output
test
e2e
eval
build
perf
test-results
playwright-report
**/.pytest_cache
**/__pycache__
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.DS_Store
# --- repo tooling the tracer would sweep into /app
*.sh
!entrypoint.sh
Dockerfile*
docker-compose.yml
.dockerignore
.gitignore
.github
playwright*.config.ts
vitest.config.ts
claude_notes
refactor_memories
# --- test sources (4 of them import ../../../eval/** and would fail the type-check once eval/ is gone)
**/__tests__
